<title>TUNISIA: Tunisie Leasing '96 results up.</title>
<headline>Tunisie Leasing '96 results up.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisie Leasing net profits amounted to 2.662 million dinars in 1996, up from 2.236 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Monday.</p>
<p>The privately-owned lease firm said its total balance sheet in 1996 was 116.696 million dinars, up from 93.428 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>Its capital and reserves were 17.942 million dinars at end of 1996, compared to 16.852 million dinars at end of 1995. ($=1.07 dinar)</p>
